sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as Attendee (via web)
  participant BK as BookingAgent
  participant T as TicketAgent
  participant N as NotificationAgent
  participant W as WaitlistAgent
  U->>BK: REQUEST book (event, 2 tickets)
  Note over BK: atomic UPDATE ... WHERE sold + q <= quantity
  BK->>T: REQUEST issue_tickets
  T-->>BK: INFORM (unique codes)
  BK-->>U: AGREE (payment ref, tickets)
  BK--)N: INFORM booking_confirmed (broadcast)
  U->>BK: REQUEST cancel
  BK->>T: REQUEST cancel_tickets
  BK-->>U: AGREE (refund 100/50/0 %)
  BK--)N: INFORM booking_cancelled
  BK--)W: INFORM seats_freed
  W->>BK: REQUEST hold_seats (first in queue)
  BK-->>W: AGREE
  W--)N: INFORM seats_offered
  Note over W: Scheduler sweep expires unclaimed holds and re-offers
